description: Go/Wails backend conventions for Tinkerpad
globs: backend/**/*.go,main.go
alwaysApply: false
---

# Backend (Go / Wails)

- Services under `backend/<name>` with `New` + `Boot`; bound from `main.go`.
- PHP runs: `backend/php` — `RunResult` envelope; sessions in `session.go`.
- Local/Docker/SSH must not start the process with cwd = user project for the PHAR (runner chdirs after autoload).
- Config dir via xdg: `~/Library/Application Support/Tinkerpad` on macOS (extracts embedded resources on boot).
- Storage JSON patterns follow `favorites` / `projects` (same config dir).
- Run `gofmt` on touched Go files. Prefer `make build` to verify embed of `frontend/dist` + `resources`.
